suspended. In contrast, an investment in a listed REIT is a liquid investment, as shares generally can be sold on an exchange at any time. </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
