that fiscal quarter. </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Our NAV per share will be calculated by our fund administrator, Bank of New York Mellon Corporation
