<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The per share amount of distributions on Class&nbsp;T shares, Class&nbsp;S shares, Class&nbsp;D shares and Class&nbsp;I shares will generally
