<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">We intend to conduct our operations so that we and most, if not all, of our wholly and majority-owned subsidiaries will comply with the 40%
test and/or comply with the requirements for reliance on the exception from the definition of investment company provided by Section&nbsp;3(c)(5)(C) of the Investment Company Act, which is available for entities &#147;primarily engaged in the
