resolved in a manner favorable to us. </I></B></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">We are subject to conflicts of interest arising out of our relationship with J.P. Morgan and its affiliates,
