and 25% refurbishment, redevelopment and development properties. We do not expect our property portfolio will consist of more than 10% of assets located outside the United States. Our investments focus on a range of asset types. These may include
multifamily, industrial, net lease, retail and office assets, as well as other asset types, including, without limitation, healthcare, student housing, single family residential, senior living, data centers, manufactured housing, hotel and storage
properties. To a lesser extent, we will also invest in real estate value creation opportunities that incorporate property refurbishment, redevelopment and development. For example, we may develop land owned as part of our investment in an office or
industrial property. These types of projects may enable us to enter or extend our presence in key markets at an attractive cost basis. In addition, an investment in a development project may be desirable because the quality or type of property we
