independent directors, and disclosed to stockholders in our next quarterly report, along with justification for such excess. This limitation includes indebtedness for money borrowed with respect to our real estate debt portfolio. &#147;Net
assets&#148; is defined as our total assets other than intangibles valued at cost (prior to deducting depreciation, reserves for bad debts and <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">other&nbsp;non-cash&nbsp;reserves)</FONT> less total liabilities. </P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Our charter prohibits us from obtaining loans from any of our directors, the Adviser or any of their affiliates, unless approved by a majority of our board of
