Company Act, we may deviate from our target allocations and invest less than 80% of our gross asset value in real estate and real estate debt or greater than 20% of our gross asset value in real estate-related securities, or invest all or any
portion of our assets in U.S. government securities, including bills, notes and bonds differing as to maturity and rates of interest that are either issued or guaranteed by the U.S. Treasury or by U.S. government agencies or instrumentalities;
