<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">For purposes of determining whether we satisfy the 55%/25% test, based on <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">the&nbsp;no-action&nbsp;letters</FONT> issued by
