<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><I>Management Fee.</I> As compensation for its services provided pursuant to the Advisory Agreement, we pay the Adviser a management fee equal to 1.00% of our
