<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Approximately 68% of the aggregate funds raised from investors by the prior programs during the <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">ten-year</FONT> period ended
