<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">During the <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">ten-year</FONT> period ended December&nbsp;31, 2021, approximately 221 investments in real estate properties were
