<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The Adviser may elect to receive its management fee in cash, Class&nbsp;E shares, Class&nbsp;I shares, Class&nbsp;E units or Class&nbsp;I units, and
