Special Limited Partner may exchange Class&nbsp;I units for a corresponding number of Class&nbsp;I shares at any time. The Adviser and the Special Limited Partner will have the option of exchanging shares of any class of our common stock for a
number of shares of any other class with an equivalent aggregate NAV. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B>Special Limited Partner Interest </B></P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">So long as the Advisory Agreement has not been terminated (including by means of <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">non-renewal),</FONT> the Special Limited
