</P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The Jobs Act was signed into law on December&nbsp;22, 2017 and made significant changes to the U.S. federal income tax rules for taxation of individuals
