<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Conditions (1)&nbsp;through (4), inclusive, must be met during the entire taxable year. Condition (5)&nbsp;must be met during at least 335 days of a taxable
