<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><I>Repurchases of Our Common Stock</I>. A repurchase of our common stock that is not treated as a sale or exchange will be taxed in the same manner as regular
