<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">On November&nbsp;15, 2021, the Company was capitalized with a $200,000 investment by the Adviser in exchange for 20,000 shares of the Company&#146;s
