Company&#146;s share repurchase plan is not repurchased or when the Company&#146;s share repurchase plan has been suspended. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">In addition, subject to
