&#147;JPM Interest&#148;) represent a 24.99% or lesser interest in the Company, the Company will, or will cause the JPMREIT OP to, automatically and without further action by the JPM Investor, repurchase or redeem, as applicable, an amount of shares
or units from the JPM Investor as may be necessary to cause the JPM Interest to remain equal to or less than 24.99% (each such repurchase or redemption, a &#147;JPM Regulatory Repurchase&#148;). To the extent the Adviser elects to receive its
management fee in shares of the Company&#146;s common stock or Operating Partnership units, the Company may repurchase those shares or units without regard to the limitations described above or the early repurchase deduction. </P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">On November&nbsp;15, 2021, the Company was capitalized with a $200,000 investment by the Adviser in exchange for 20,000 shares of the Company&#146;s
