<TD WIDTH="5%" VALIGN="top" ALIGN="left">A.</TD>
<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">Participants will acquire Shares from the Company (including Shares purchased by the Company for the Plan in a
secondary market (if available) or on a stock exchange (if listed)) under the Plan (the &#147;<U>Plan Shares</U>&#148;) at a price equal to the net asset value (&#147;<U>NAV</U>&#148;) per Share applicable to the class of Shares purchased by the
Participant on the date that the Distribution is payable (calculated as of the most recent month end). No upfront selling commissions will be payable with respect to Shares purchased pursuant to the Plan, but such Shares may be subject to ongoing
stockholder servicing fees. Participants in the Plan may purchase fractional Shares so that 100% of the Distributions will be used to acquire Shares. However, a Participant will not be able to acquire Plan Shares and such Participant&#146;s
participation in the Plan will be terminated to the extent that a reinvestment of such Participant&#146;s Distributions in Shares would cause the percentage ownership or other limitations contained in the Charter to be violated.
</P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
